Package: carnine-voice
Version: 1.13.8-1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Carnine Project
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6
Description: Offline voice for Carnine's spoken turn announcements
 sherpa-onnx 1.13.8 (C API and ONNX Runtime) and the German Piper voices
 thorsten-medium and thorsten-low. The backend loads them at run time;
 [voice] in its configuration picks the voice.
